{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i>Hamspater is a simple side-scrolling roguelike game that requires control.</i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i>To keep your hamster alive and attack effectively, you must focus on movement control.</i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[\u25bc How to Play]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1.\u00a0Hunt slimes to equip weapons in <strong>the Left / Right / Jump / Drop slots</strong> and evolve them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u2605 Move left or right controls to fire <strong>Left / Right weapons</strong> faster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u2605 Jump (or drop) controls to fire useful <strong>Jump / Drop weapons</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2.\u00a0Defeat slimes and survive for <strong>20 minutes</strong> to get more gold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3.\u00a0Upgrade with the gold you get to survive more easily and hunt slimes more efficiently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u2605 Use gold to unlock other characters or increase the number of rerolls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203b\u00a0A total of 24 weapons, 3 characters, and 3 stages are available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203b\u00a0I have prepared this game so that you can play it using a keyboard and mouse, a gamepad, or a joystick.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203b\u00a0This game is only available in English, but its simple design makes it easy to understand.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Hamspater","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3598190/3a90e688d4d3a78b0e60074e08036231408568e8.jpg"},{"name":"Cattain","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3598190/b2ae32c9f8281df890dcea091fc1f501daf0dbc5.jpg"},{"name":"Dogtor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/35